# Muscular Dystrophy external news feed source package (pipe-delimited)
#
# Every source is disabled by default and installation requires acceptance of
# the external news feed sources agreement. Display is limited to headline,
# date, publisher attribution and outbound link.
#
source_id|name|endpoint|category|feed_kind|enabled_by_default|publisher|classification|reviewed|fields_displayed|permission|commercial_use|attribution|terms_url|rights_or_corrections_contact|notes
medlineplus-muscular-dystrophy|MedlinePlus · Muscular Dystrophy|https://medlineplus.gov/feeds/topics/musculardystrophy.xml|Research|headlineOnly|false|MedlinePlus / U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official exact-topic RSS with restricted reuse|1 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, source attribution and outbound link only|MedlinePlus offers the topic RSS feed, but its content-use policy limits feeds to personal use and does not authorize use in websites or information services|Not authorized by the published RSS terms|Credit MedlinePlus and the U.S. National Library of Medicine and link to the original page|https://medlineplus.gov/about/using/usingcontent/|https://medlineplus.gov/about/contactus.html|Verified HTTP 200 text/xml exact Muscular Dystrophy topic RSS. Disabled and agreement-gated; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
nlm-news-muscular-dystrophy|National Library of Medicine · News|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/rss/nlmnews.rss|Research|headlineOnly|false|U.S. National Library of Medicine|Official broad NLM news RSS; locally filtered|1 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, NLM attribution and outbound link only|NLM states that U.S. government works may be used with source acknowledgement; third-party contributions can retain copyright|Government works may be reused; verify third-party material and do not imply endorsement|Credit the National Library of Medicine and link to the original item|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/web_policies.html|https://support.nlm.nih.gov/|Disabled and locally filtered for explicit muscular-dystrophy relevance; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
nlm-director-muscular-dystrophy|NLM Director · Musings from the Mezzanine|https://nlmdirector.nlm.nih.gov/feed/|Research|headlineOnly|false|U.S. National Library of Medicine · Office of the Director|Official broad NLM research and informatics RSS; locally filtered|1 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, NLM attribution and outbound link only|NLM states that U.S. government works may be used with source acknowledgement; third-party contributions can retain copyright|Government works may be reused; verify third-party material and do not imply endorsement|Credit the National Library of Medicine and link to the original item|https://www.nlm.nih.gov/web_policies.html|https://support.nlm.nih.gov/|Disabled and locally filtered for explicit muscular-dystrophy relevance; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
mda-quest-muscular-dystrophy|MDA Quest|https://mdaquest.org/feed/|Community|headlineOnly|false|Muscular Dystrophy Association · Quest|US neuromuscular community and lifestyle RSS with restricted reuse|1 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, publisher attribution and outbound link only|MDA terms require prior written permission for reproduction or third-party redistribution; feed availability does not provide broader permission|Not permitted under reviewed standard terms without written authorization|Credit MDA Quest and the named contributor and link to the original item|https://www.mda.org/terms-of-use|https://www.mda.org/about-mda/contact-us|Verified HTTP 200 application/rss+xml feed covering muscular dystrophy and other neuromuscular communities. Disabled, agreement-gated and strictly locally filtered; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
muscular-dystrophy-uk|Muscular Dystrophy UK|https://www.musculardystrophyuk.org/feed/|Community|headlineOnly|false|Muscular Dystrophy UK|UK charity research, support, advocacy and community RSS|1 August 2026|Exact headline, publication date, charity attribution and outbound link only|A public RSS endpoint is available, but broad reuse permission was not verified and the charity covers more than 60 muscle-wasting and weakening conditions|Not verified; keep disabled pending charity permission|Credit Muscular Dystrophy UK and link to the original item|https://www.musculardystrophyuk.org/terms-and-conditions/|https://www.musculardystrophyuk.org/contact-us/|Verified HTTP 200 application/rss+xml feed. Disabled, agreement-gated and strictly locally filtered for the muscular dystrophy umbrella and named subtypes; no summary, image or article body is stored or displayed.
